skin-engine — vendored rendering engine from @linxin666/dsh-client-ui-skin-center
================================================================================

The files under this directory (and src/client/skin-engine/ on the client side)
are vendored from the dsh-skins repository (the DSH Web UI skin center):

  https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-skins
  package: @linxin666/dsh-client-ui-skin-center

Vendored modules (unmodified except for module paths):

  css-safety/transform.ts               CSS safety pipeline (force-scoping + whitelist)
  css-safety/fallback.ts                automatic official-token fallback tints
  css-safety/official-tokens.generated.ts  official token registry (generated data)
  provenance.ts                         market provenance / reviewed-hooks verification
  reviewed-hooks.generated.ts           reviewed hooks identity registry (generated data)
  ../client/skin-engine/skin-controller.ts   atomic skin switch engine
  ../client/skin-engine/effect-ledger.ts     activation-scoped effect ledger
  ../client/skin-engine/decoration-layers.ts six fixed decoration layers
  ../client/skin-engine/backdrop-scene.ts    scene backdrop coordination
  ../client/skin-engine/semantic-adapter.ts  L2 semantic-attribute stamping
  ../client/skin-engine/shell-rendering.ts   public shell rendering adapter

